    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Find Beauty in Decay</p></blockquote><p>Druids of the Circle of Spores find beauty in decay. They see in mold and other fungi the power to turn lifeless matter into abundant, if strange, life. For them, life and death are parts of a grand cycle: death is not the end of life but a change of state, in which life takes a new form. They see nothing inherently wrong with undeath, a companion to life and death, but they believe the cycle is healthiest when each part of it stays vibrant and changing.</p><p><em>Subclass of Tasha's Cauldron of Everything, adapted to the 2024 rules by Owidyn.</em></p><h3>Circle of Spores Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.ydrVtgQCNwDAP8pJ]{Circle of Spores Spells}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.6rIWTDwGwGF4uFSJ]{Halo of Spores}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.3Agm32pFcdnsmnYt]{Symbiotic Entity}</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.l7XAg96ICbgfxZJn]{Fungal Infestation}</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.ImkCjTLhNR1TPopk]{Spreading Spores}</td></tr><tr><td>14</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.icHnKiKn6FD4Tw9H]{Fungal Body}</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Circle of Spores Spells</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Druid Level</th><th>Spells</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplChillTouch]{Chill Touch}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplBlindnessD]{Blindness/Deafness}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplGentleRepo]{Gentle Repose}</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplAnimateDea]{Animate Dead}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplGaseousFor]{Gaseous Form}</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplBlight0000]{Blight}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplConfusion0]{Confusion}</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplCloudkill0]{Cloudkill}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplContagion0]{Contagion}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
